  "title": "Jean's Swedish Faux Meatballs",
  "description": "Burger-style crumbles (or TVP) combined with bread crumbs, onion and milk and formed into 'meat' balls, then baked with a creamy gravy. Excellent served with 'no-yolk' noodles and your favorite vegetable.",
  "authors": [
    "COURTNEYSUNSHINE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-08-11T13:19:18-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2020-03-09T22:50:23-04:00",
